      "writtenOn": "2019-12-08T16:15:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does it really matter as much even if the value is read torn for memory accounting?\n\nGreg, its not actually debugging, this may even be used to find out how bad the system is under memory pressure in user space. Plus it is going to be in all devices.\n\nI don\u0027t fully understand the problem here, but if there is one, lets fix it for both 32- and 64-bit devices and not assume we are only running on aarch64?",
      "parentUuid": "9c99df55_9b90f91a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 31,
